<p> United Kingdom    7.8    7.5     7.5    7.3     7.1    6.9</p>
<p> Canada		9.5    9.7     9.5    9.4     9.2    9.1</p>
<p> European Union   11.4   11.4    11.4   11.2    11.0   10.8</p>
<p> Total OECD	  7.9    7.7     7.7    7.7     7.6    7.5</p>
